      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda Afuga Amagye akoba ati: “Ekiseera ekyo bwe kirituuka, ensulo eriigulwagho olw'okunaaza ebibi n'obwonoonefu ku baidhukulu ba Daudi n'abantu b'omu Yerusalemu, basobole okwetukuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nditoola mu nsi Isiraeli ebisinzibwa ebitali Katonda, ghalobe kubaagho muntu abiidhukira waire okwidhukira amaina gaabyo. Nditoolagho n'abo boonaboona abeeyeta abalanzi, era naatoola ni mu bantu omwoyo ogwenda okusinza ebitali Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe ghalibaagho ole alyenda okweyeta omulanzi, ise n'inhina balimukoba bati ateekwa okwitibwa, olw'okwogera eby'obuguya aye ate n'abyeta ebibono bya Musengwa Katonda. Era bw'aligezaaku okukola obulanzi, ise n'inhina abo balimufumita yaafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo, buli mulanzi okubonekerwa kwe kulimugemya ensoni, yaatya n'okukola obulanzi, waire okuvaala ekivaalo eky'obuviiri okulimbira okwo abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye alikoba bukobe ati, ‘Nze tiri mulanzi, ndi mulimi bulimi. Era eitaka n'ekibaire eky'obukombe kyange okuva mu buto.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era ole bw'alimubuuza ati, ‘Ate ebibwa ebikuli mu mugongo?’ Alimwiramu ati, ‘Ebibwa ebyo nabifunira mu ndhu ya bakagwa bange.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
